+     * Root-caused on-device to a "Favorite Apps" icon going invisible: launch
+     * an app -> the resulting list rescan starts that fade on the just-left
+     * row right as this Activity is paused -> the animation gets cut off
+     * mid-fade -> the tile comes back from onResume() with its icon's alpha
+     * stuck near 0. See also AppFragment.AppViewHolder#bind()'s alpha reset,
+     * which is a second line of defense against the same symptom regardless
+     * of cause.
+     *
      * @param another Item to compare to
      * @return True if items should appear identical
      */
     public boolean areContentsTheSame(LaunchItem another) {
-        return Objects.equals(another.getBanner(), getBanner())
-                && Objects.equals(another.getIcon(), getIcon())
-                && Objects.equals(another.getLabel(), getLabel());
+        return Objects.equals(another.getLabel(), getLabel());
     }
 
     @Override
