+<!-- Fills the empty right side of the hero region (the backdrop image
+     alone otherwise leaves this whole area visually inert) with a real
+     device-status card, matching the small "quick status" widgets several
+     other smart TV home screens (Samsung Tizen, LG webOS) show on their
+     own home screen; real Wi-Fi network/signal and storage numbers,
+     read the same way NetworkLaunchItem already does elsewhere in this
+     launcher, not invented content. See
